{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16985","headline":"冬日汉江南行将赴夏口途次江陵界寄裴尚书 · 武元衡","name":"冬日汉江南行将赴夏口途次江陵界寄裴尚书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五部拥双旌，南依墨客卿。\n关山迥梁甸，波浪接湓城。\n烟景迷时候，云帆渺去程。\n蛤珠冯月吐，芦雁触罗惊。\n浦树凝寒晦，江天湛镜清。\n赏心随处惬，壮志逐年轻。\n舟檝不可驻，提封如任情。\n向方曾指路，射策许言兵。\n兰渚歇芳意，菱歌非应声。\n元戎武昌守，羊祜幸连营。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16985.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16985","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}